<!--Post: 5045--><!--Time: 1106856335-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5045"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 12:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Speculation is largely why we&#39;re here; what happened was that earlier I saw a couple of posts which were already declaring Marine Hedge and Dee Davis definite BTK victims. I don&#39;t think that&#39;s the best way to go about things, but heck, it&#39;s Tom&#39;s board. Where is Tom, anyway? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
